  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 103.43 Limited service",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 103.43 “Limited service” means the service type provided by a public or private facility which, through the conditions of the permit, allows the facility to receive authorized waste from specified sources only.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100) #8460-B, eff 10-28-05; ss by #14103, effective 10-23-24 (formerly Env-Sw 103.38) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100)",
